OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy and
OL,6,Fdamp start to the night with some
OL,7,Frain, before turning drier later in
OL,8,Fthe night, especially across northern
OL,9,Fareas. Light winds but breezy along
OL,10,Fthe coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FAny early rain affecting
OL,13,Fmore southern areas will clear
OL,14,Fsouthwards to leave a drier and
OL,15,Fincreasingly brighter day on Thursday.
OL,16,FFrost likely overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
