OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FLargely
OL,6,Fdry with some sunshine Friday and
OL,7,FSaturday but a chance of coastal
OL,8,Fshowers. Temperatures near or below
OL,9,Fnormal. Mostly light winds. Cloudier
OL,10,Fwith rain possible later on Sunday.
